      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p01307",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "“杀，杀……”他不由的反复呢喃。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "\"Kill, kill...\" he murmured over and over in spite of himself.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p01307",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "至于杀谁呢？",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "As for whom he would kill?",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p01307",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "——他心里有数。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "He knew perfectly well in his heart.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p01307",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "他记起那是一个非常卑鄙的留平头的男人。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "He remembered that it was an extremely despicable man with close-cropped hair.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
